WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Brother Shen, why is Caiying appearing in front of me?

2
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,500
You and Zha Guang are not allowed to drink anymore.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,980
It seems that three Extraordinaries in our team have lost their fighting ability.

4
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,980
Blame me. You should save some Huangyang wine.

5
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,980
Wine? Where can I find Huangyang wine?

6
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:31,020
Why is the luster of Heixin even more intense than the last bullet wolf group?

7
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:34,020
The danger behind is very small, so you can scream

8
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,020
Attention the dumper on the other side

9
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:39,600
I am Shen Chui

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,330
Congratulations, you are safe

11
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:46,330
Everyone will immediately be in front of our team.

12
00:00:46,330 --> 00:00:48,330
I will solve the crisis behind you

13
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:50,330
It smells like a ghost doctor

14
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:57,860
Is the perception good?

15
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:58,860
It's the ghost doctor
